      "type": "solution",
      "difficulty": 2,
      "content": "设 $F(x) = \\int_0^{x^2} \\sin t\\,dt$，求 $F'(x)$。",
      "answer": "$F'(x) = 2x\\cdot\\sin(x^2)$",
      "solutionSteps": [
        "令 $u = x^2$，则 $F(x) = \\int_0^u \\sin t dt$",
        "由链式法则：$F'(x) = (\\frac{dF}{du})\\cdot(\\frac{du}{dx})$",
        "$\\frac{dF}{du} = \\sin u = \\sin(x^2)$",
        "du/dx = 2x",
        "$F'(x) = \\sin(x^2) \\cdot 2x = 2x\\cdot\\sin(x^2)$"
      ],
