      "solutionSteps": [
        "$\\int_1^+\\infty \\frac{1}{x}^2 dx = \\lim_{b \\to +\\infty} \\int_1^b x^{-2}dx$",
        "$= \\lim_{b \\to +\\infty} [-\\frac{1}{x}]_1^b$",
        "$= \\lim_{b \\to +\\infty} (-\\frac{1}{b} + 1) = 0 + 1 = 1$",
        "极限存在，故收敛，值为 1"
      ],
